/**\
 * V15.2 "THE FINAL STANDARD" - Certified Gold Edition\
 * \
 * FINAL ARCHITECTURAL SPECIFICATIONS:\
 * 1. ASIL-D Compliant 2oo2 Redundancy: Dual-path torque calculation with cross-validation.\
 * 2. Linear Temperature Fading: Seamless transition between cold-start and operating modes.\
 * 3. Altitude Safety Management: Automatic turbo protection based on barometric pressure.\
